WEBVTT

1
00:00:34.791 --> 00:00:37.416
In the previous verses, Lord Krishna

2
00:00:37.416 --> 00:00:40.375
showed Arjun the vision of the Vishwarupa.

3
00:00:40.375 --> 00:00:43.625
Now in this verse of Chapter 11, Lord Krishna

4
00:00:43.625 --> 00:00:47.875
tells Arjun to rise, fight,

5
00:00:47.875 --> 00:00:50.166
and win glory.

6
00:00:50.166 --> 00:00:52.250
He assures Arjun

7
00:00:52.250 --> 00:00:54.000
that by divine arrangement,

8
00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:56.375
the end of all the warriors

9
00:00:56.375 --> 00:00:58.583
has already been determined.

10
00:00:58.583 --> 00:00:59.708
Arjun's role

11
00:00:59.708 --> 00:01:03.875
is only to act as an instrument.

12
00:01:03.875 --> 00:01:06.958
This verse, with surrender to the divine will,

13
00:01:06.958 --> 00:01:10.333
being unattached to results,

14
00:01:10.333 --> 00:01:14.375
emphasises fulfilling one's duty.

15
00:01:19.250 --> 00:01:21.500
Lord Krishna tells Arjun

16
00:01:21.500 --> 00:01:24.083
that the end of the warriors on the battlefield

17
00:01:24.083 --> 00:01:26.250
has already been determined.

18
00:01:26.250 --> 00:01:29.333
This removes Arjun's hesitation.

19
00:01:29.333 --> 00:01:32.458
He understands that the outcome of the war

20
00:01:32.458 --> 00:01:35.083
does not depend on him alone.

21
00:01:35.083 --> 00:01:37.833
Lord Krishna is not forcing Arjun.

22
00:01:37.833 --> 00:01:40.541
He is, to fulfil his duty,

23
00:01:40.541 --> 00:01:42.833
guiding him.

24
00:01:42.833 --> 00:01:44.958
He assures him

25
00:01:44.958 --> 00:01:47.875
that victory is already certain.

26
00:01:47.875 --> 00:01:51.750
The key idea here is nimitt matra bhav.

27
00:01:51.750 --> 00:01:54.958
This idea teaches that we should act.

28
00:01:54.958 --> 00:01:56.458
But remember

29
00:01:56.458 --> 00:02:00.583
that the final outcome is
subject to the divine will.

30
00:02:00.583 --> 00:02:04.041
We are only instruments for action.

31
00:02:04.041 --> 00:02:05.458
Arjun's task

32
00:02:05.458 --> 00:02:08.875
is to align with that plan.

33
00:02:08.875 --> 00:02:12.333
It is not to take personal credit for success.

34
00:02:12.333 --> 00:02:13.916
In our lives too,

35
00:02:13.916 --> 00:02:15.833
out of fear of failure

36
00:02:15.833 --> 00:02:18.291
we hold back from acting.

37
00:02:18.291 --> 00:02:19.166
But

38
00:02:19.166 --> 00:02:20.750
when we, to a higher purpose,

39
00:02:20.750 --> 00:02:22.375
become dedicated,

40
00:02:22.375 --> 00:02:25.708
then our actions become meaningful.

41
00:02:25.708 --> 00:02:28.750
We stop worrying about results

42
00:02:28.750 --> 00:02:30.416
and in the process itself

43
00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.875
begin to find deep peace.

44
00:02:32.875 --> 00:02:34.750
Lord Krishna's words

45
00:02:34.750 --> 00:02:36.500
also make clear

46
00:02:36.500 --> 00:02:41.250
that spiritual life is not about being passive.

47
00:02:41.250 --> 00:02:43.416
Arjun, to sit idle

48
00:02:43.416 --> 00:02:45.333
and wait for fate,

49
00:02:45.333 --> 00:02:47.208
is certainly not being asked.

50
00:02:47.208 --> 00:02:49.166
He must act,

51
00:02:49.166 --> 00:02:52.166
but with the understanding
that true victory is not

52
00:02:52.166 --> 00:02:53.708
merely material success,

53
00:02:53.708 --> 00:02:56.750
but spiritual growth.

54
00:02:56.750 --> 00:02:58.875
This applies to all of us too.

55
00:02:58.875 --> 00:03:01.333
Whether work, relationships,

56
00:03:01.333 --> 00:03:03.208
or personal goals,

57
00:03:03.208 --> 00:03:06.083
we must give our best effort.

58
00:03:06.083 --> 00:03:07.166
At the same time,

59
00:03:07.166 --> 00:03:08.416
in the divine power's great

60
00:03:08.416 --> 00:03:11.541
plan we must trust.

61
00:03:11.541 --> 00:03:14.541
In this verse, Lord Krishna
also speaks of bhunksva,

62
00:03:14.541 --> 00:03:17.791
that is, enjoying divine joy.

63
00:03:17.791 --> 00:03:21.291
He encourages Arjun to act according to dharma

64
00:03:21.291 --> 00:03:24.000
and to enjoy the fruits of his efforts.

65
00:03:24.000 --> 00:03:25.791
He encourages.

66
00:03:25.791 --> 00:03:27.833
He says that true joy

67
00:03:27.833 --> 00:03:30.083
is not the pleasure sought

68
00:03:30.083 --> 00:03:31.708
only for oneself,

69
00:03:31.708 --> 00:03:34.625
but the satisfaction that comes from service

70
00:03:34.625 --> 00:03:37.958
done for a greater purpose.

71
00:03:37.958 --> 00:03:41.250
Just as a river, for the balance of nature,

72
00:03:41.250 --> 00:03:43.708
flows naturally,

73
00:03:43.708 --> 00:03:47.083
in the same way a devotee too, if their actions,

74
00:03:47.083 --> 00:03:49.875
aligning with the divine will,

75
00:03:49.875 --> 00:03:54.208
performs, then attains real joy.

76
00:03:54.208 --> 00:03:56.666
When we act with devotion,

77
00:03:56.666 --> 00:03:59.375
then we, of a power far greater

78
00:03:59.375 --> 00:04:01.583
than ourselves, become instruments.

79
00:04:06.416 --> 00:04:10.166
Sometimes the mind grows anxious,

80
00:04:10.166 --> 00:04:15.750
'What if my efforts go to waste?'

81
00:04:15.750 --> 00:04:18.416
You prepare for an exam,

82
00:04:18.416 --> 00:04:22.250
stay up through the night studying, yet

83
00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:25.125
fear lingers in the mind.

84
00:04:25.125 --> 00:04:28.166
Think about this.

85
00:04:28.166 --> 00:04:31.666
This anxiety about results,

86
00:04:31.666 --> 00:04:33.750
does it bring any benefit?

87
00:04:33.750 --> 00:04:35.375
See,

88
00:04:35.375 --> 00:04:38.916
just as I told Arjun

89
00:04:38.916 --> 00:04:40.666
that the warriors' destruction

90
00:04:40.666 --> 00:04:43.708
is already determined,

91
00:04:43.708 --> 00:04:47.833
in the same way, the fruit of your efforts too,

92
00:04:47.833 --> 00:04:51.958
according to a great plan, is set.

93
00:04:51.958 --> 00:04:54.375
Understand it in today's terms,

94
00:04:54.375 --> 00:04:58.916
just as you go to give a job interview,

95
00:04:58.916 --> 00:05:00.875
prepare well,

96
00:05:00.875 --> 00:05:04.166
and try with complete honesty too,

97
00:05:04.166 --> 00:05:08.291
yet you do not know whether you will get the job

98
00:05:08.291 --> 00:05:09.500
or not.

99
00:05:09.500 --> 00:05:12.541
The result is not in your hands.

100
00:05:12.541 --> 00:05:16.458
Make your plans wisely.

101
00:05:16.458 --> 00:05:20.083
Connect them to good purposes.

102
00:05:20.083 --> 00:05:24.000
When your goals, for the help of others

103
00:05:24.000 --> 00:05:27.416
or for spiritual growth, are made,

104
00:05:27.416 --> 00:05:33.125
then both success and peace are found.

105
00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:34.583
Do your work

106
00:05:34.583 --> 00:05:38.750
with attention, give your best,

107
00:05:38.750 --> 00:05:42.875
and release concern about the results.

108
00:05:42.875 --> 00:05:47.166
If the result is favourable, celebrate.

109
00:05:47.166 --> 00:05:51.000
If it is unfavourable, remain happy even then,

110
00:05:51.000 --> 00:05:53.708
because whatever happens

111
00:05:53.708 --> 00:05:57.750
happens by the will of the divine power,

112
00:05:57.750 --> 00:05:59.125
and it always

113
00:05:59.125 --> 00:06:02.791
works only for your well-being.

114
00:06:02.791 --> 00:06:04.166
For example,

115
00:06:04.166 --> 00:06:09.291
if you miss the train, instead of worrying, think,

116
00:06:09.291 --> 00:06:12.833
perhaps there is some good in it, and

117
00:06:12.833 --> 00:06:16.791
on the next train you may get a better seat,

118
00:06:16.791 --> 00:06:21.583
or meet an old friend along the way.

119
00:06:26.500 --> 00:06:29.041
In family life, enjoying happiness

120
00:06:29.041 --> 00:06:33.916
and prosperity is not wrong.

121
00:06:33.916 --> 00:06:35.708
It is natural.

122
00:06:35.708 --> 00:06:39.958
When you live life according to dharma

123
00:06:39.958 --> 00:06:41.833
and your duties

124
00:06:41.833 --> 00:06:44.291
fulfil with honesty.

125
00:06:44.291 --> 00:06:46.125
See,

126
00:06:46.125 --> 00:06:49.166
just as I told Arjun,

127
00:06:49.166 --> 00:06:54.416
fight and enjoy the fruits of victory,
in the same way

128
00:06:54.416 --> 00:06:56.875
you too, for success

129
00:06:56.875 --> 00:06:59.708
and happiness, can wish.

130
00:06:59.708 --> 00:07:02.166
But remember,

131
00:07:02.166 --> 00:07:05.625
true happiness is found

132
00:07:05.625 --> 00:07:07.500
when your actions

133
00:07:07.500 --> 00:07:10.583
are connected to a greater purpose.

134
00:07:10.583 --> 00:07:13.458
When your family, with honesty

135
00:07:13.458 --> 00:07:17.000
and compassion, works,

136
00:07:17.000 --> 00:07:19.750
then prosperity comes.

137
00:07:19.750 --> 00:07:21.750
Financial success,

138
00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:26.125
strong relationships, or good health,

139
00:07:26.125 --> 00:07:29.875
all these blessings come to you.

140
00:07:29.875 --> 00:07:34.791
These are all parts of an ideal life.

141
00:07:34.791 --> 00:07:39.625
But if you, ignoring dharma,

142
00:07:39.625 --> 00:07:42.416
seek happiness,

143
00:07:42.416 --> 00:07:46.041
then that success feels hollow

144
00:07:46.041 --> 00:07:49.666
and fades quickly.

145
00:07:49.666 --> 00:07:52.583
Embrace the wisdom of the Gita.

146
00:07:52.583 --> 00:07:58.708
See yourself as an instrument of My plan.

147
00:07:58.708 --> 00:08:01.166
How to live?

148
00:08:01.166 --> 00:08:04.291
Care for one another.

149
00:08:04.291 --> 00:08:07.500
Help those in need.

150
00:08:07.500 --> 00:08:10.500
Grow spiritually.

151
00:08:10.500 --> 00:08:15.125
And also achieve worldly success.

152
00:08:15.125 --> 00:08:18.083
When you live this way,

153
00:08:18.083 --> 00:08:22.500
then prosperity becomes a blessing.

154
00:08:22.500 --> 00:08:23.958
See,

155
00:08:23.958 --> 00:08:27.166
a family saves honestly.

156
00:08:27.166 --> 00:08:29.166
It gives in charity too.

157
00:08:29.166 --> 00:08:33.333
In the beginning it seems that money is less,

158
00:08:33.333 --> 00:08:36.625
but gradually, watch,

159
00:08:36.625 --> 00:08:39.625
abundance comes to their home,

160
00:08:39.625 --> 00:08:41.708
happiness and peace come.

161
00:08:41.708 --> 00:08:46.166
This is, this is real prosperity.

162
00:08:46.166 --> 00:08:48.375
It gives comfort

163
00:08:48.375 --> 00:08:51.833
and inner peace too.

164
00:08:51.833 --> 00:08:53.416
Why?

165
00:08:53.416 --> 00:08:56.000
Because you know

166
00:08:56.000 --> 00:09:00.500
that the foundation of your success is strong.

167
00:09:00.500 --> 00:09:05.333
The well-being of all and a meaningful purpose.

168
00:09:10.166 --> 00:09:11.166
At work,

169
00:09:11.166 --> 00:09:15.000
while leading an important project,

170
00:09:15.000 --> 00:09:19.375
do you think everything rests on me?

171
00:09:19.375 --> 00:09:20.875
Whatever the result,

172
00:09:20.875 --> 00:09:23.291
responsible for it will be only

173
00:09:23.291 --> 00:09:24.833
and only me?

174
00:09:24.833 --> 00:09:26.166
Understand.

175
00:09:26.166 --> 00:09:28.625
In your professional life, only

176
00:09:28.625 --> 00:09:32.583
the mindset of considering yourself the doer

177
00:09:32.583 --> 00:09:34.916
brings two problems.

178
00:09:34.916 --> 00:09:37.833
On succeeding, it brings ego,

179
00:09:37.833 --> 00:09:42.416
and on failing, it brings self-doubt.

180
00:09:42.416 --> 00:09:45.833
But understand one thing,

181
00:09:45.833 --> 00:09:48.625
your actions matter,

182
00:09:48.625 --> 00:09:51.333
but the final outcome

183
00:09:51.333 --> 00:09:54.041
is beyond your control.

184
00:09:54.041 --> 00:09:56.083
See,

185
00:09:56.083 --> 00:09:59.625
just as I told Arjun,

186
00:09:59.625 --> 00:10:01.833
the warriors' destruction

187
00:10:01.833 --> 00:10:04.250
was already determined,

188
00:10:04.250 --> 00:10:05.791
in the same way

189
00:10:05.791 --> 00:10:08.833
the results of your efforts too,

190
00:10:08.833 --> 00:10:14.541
by many factors, are already determined.

191
00:10:14.541 --> 00:10:17.500
What is your role?

192
00:10:17.500 --> 00:10:21.416
To act as an instrument.

193
00:10:21.416 --> 00:10:23.833
Without attachment to the result,

194
00:10:23.833 --> 00:10:26.458
to give your very best.

195
00:10:26.458 --> 00:10:27.625
When you

196
00:10:27.625 --> 00:10:31.500
let go of the doer mindset,

197
00:10:31.500 --> 00:10:33.750
what happens?

198
00:10:33.750 --> 00:10:38.000
Success does not feed your ego.

199
00:10:38.000 --> 00:10:43.166
Failure does not shake your confidence.

200
00:10:43.166 --> 00:10:47.750
You, both as parts of a larger plan,

201
00:10:47.750 --> 00:10:49.250
learn to see.

202
00:10:49.250 --> 00:10:54.333
Just as you, at the office,
do some important task,

203
00:10:54.333 --> 00:10:57.583
work hard, prepare well.

204
00:10:57.583 --> 00:11:02.708
Then you think, I am only an instrument.

205
00:11:02.708 --> 00:11:07.125
The result I leave to the Supreme.

206
00:11:07.125 --> 00:11:11.541
In such a case, if success comes,
ego does not arise,

207
00:11:11.541 --> 00:11:15.000
if failure comes, disappointment does not follow.

208
00:11:15.000 --> 00:11:20.125
How does this mindset set you free?

209
00:11:20.125 --> 00:11:23.125
From the pressure of constant comparison,

210
00:11:23.125 --> 00:11:27.208
from the fear of appearing small before others.

211
00:11:27.208 --> 00:11:31.666
So, your duties with honesty

212
00:11:31.666 --> 00:11:35.833
and dedication, focus on fulfilling.

213
00:11:35.833 --> 00:11:39.791
Knowing that your every step

214
00:11:39.791 --> 00:11:43.750
contributes to a greater purpose,

215
00:11:43.750 --> 00:11:45.541
even if the immediate results

216
00:11:45.541 --> 00:11:49.208
do not match your expectations.
